[size=5][b]Rust Server for OSRS revision 239[/b][/size]

A game server for Old School RuneScape revision 239, written in Rust. Its main original content is [b]The Tower[/b]: authored floors, permanent progress, skilling preparation and boss fights. The native Rust client has its own [url=https://rune-server.org/threads/ai-project-native-rust-osrs-239-1-client.708916/]thread[/url].

[b]Current state[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Core[/b]: login, a ticking world, movement, player and NPC updates, inventory, equipment, banking and saved characters
[*][b]Combat[/b]: melee, ranged and magic, prayer, NPC stats from the game cache, Dragon longsword special against NPCs
[*][b]World[/b]: aggressive NPCs, respawn timers, drop tables with killer-only drops, ambient NPCs, bank booths and banknotes
[*][b]Content port[/b]: OpenRune content ported and checked against the OSRS Wiki; not finished yet
[*][b]Ported so far[/b]: fishing, firemaking, mining (gems, clay, essence), smithing extras, herblore, cooking, crafting, food, shearing, pickpocketing, item packs, scenery
[*][b]The Tower[/b]: Floor One (the Cinderworks) runs on the main server; one full run from preparation through both bosses to the reward chest, kept after a restart
[*][b]Testing[/b]: features are played in game by a headless test client against the real server from a fresh test account, then checked again after relogging; update posts mark anything covered by tests only
[/list]

